ange the  officer fired five low lethal rounds at  mr. gomez fearing that he was going to  strike the officers with a baseball bat  mr. Gomez was struck with the beanbag  rounds and proceeded to run northbound  along Las Vegas Boulevard in front of  the courthouse  sergeant Fryman officer Emerton officer  Ferguson and Officer Loker were driving  southbound on the boulevard in route to  our downed officer call that it happened  moments before they saw mr. gomez and as  they exited their vehicles mr. Gomez  raised that rifle in their direction  these officers engaged mr. Gomez firing  several shots and striking him mr. Gomez  was transported to UMC trauma or he was  pronounced deceased will now be move  into some of these still photos and the  videos for those videos that have no  sound I'll give you a narration so that  you understand what's going on this is  mr. Gomez walking along Las Vegas  Boulevard in front of Planet Hollywood  and you'll notice that he walks past our  officers they do see him open carry and  if you look now they're turning around  watching him as he walks away he was not  doing anything illegal  therefore  or they did not engage mr. Gomez this  next video is from surveillance cameras  mounted on the building across the  street from the federal courthouse mr.  Gomez is encircled by the white circle  and you'll see him move toward the steps  he'll stop he'll have a conversation  with the officer at the top of the  stairs who was telling him to disperse  this is after the dispersal order was  given he'll exchange words with that  officer and there's other officers that  are stationed up there and to the left  here and you'll see him as they have  this exchange and the low lethal shots  are fired  it was him running back northbound in  front of the courthouse  those are low lethal rounds and that was  taken off social media and you can hear  the citizens saying he's got a gun and  then taking off Ronnie I'll take any  questions you may have  five five yes ma'am we do not we are  still looking for additional video as  you can imagine there were a number of  officers out there that night the  investigative team is still combing  through all of that video but at this  point we do not you heard it on the  video there just moments well I can tell  you obviously that he was armed with  three firearms he had a ballistic vest  on and there were indications through  the course of our investigation that  indicated us he was growing increasingly  increasingly radicalized we do not know  why we do not know all of his  perspectives we've talked to some family  members that have expressed some concern  about that but we're still learning  about mr. Gomez they were in fact the  the pistol that was inserted into the  carbine conversion kit the trigger was  disengaged which indicates to us that it  was pulled at some point however there  was an empty chamber so at some point he  did pull that trigger but whether he  knew it or not the chamber was empty  he is from Las Vegas as I understand it  he spent some time in Oregon as well one  more question and then I'm sorry he did  have one arrest for narcotics related  offenses I do not that officer has not  been interviewed yet one more question  for Miss Crosby no cut the we're still  interviewing those officers Shay was  shot a few miles down the road so I  would assume that they did not believe  that so that's all I could say right now  about that but it just I would assume  that they were aware of that so thank  you for coming out today and we'll send  more information out later thank you

